      "text": "{{#trackingEnabled}}Reminder: We’re missing your answer – {{eventTitle}}{{/trackingEnabled}}{{^trackingEnabled}}Reminder: Have you answered? – {{eventTitle}}{{/trackingEnabled}}\n\nHi{{#recipientName}} {{recipientName}}{{/recipientName}}!\n\n{{organizerName}} is reminding you about the poll{{#respondedCount}} – {{respondedCount}} have answered so far{{/respondedCount}}. If you haven’t voted yet, it takes less than a minute.\n{{#trackingEnabled}}{{/trackingEnabled}}{{^trackingEnabled}}Already answered? Then you can ignore this email – or change your answers via the personal link you got when you voted.\n{{/trackingEnabled}}{{#personalMessage}}\n\nMessage from {{organizerName}}:\n{{{personalMessage}}}\n{{/personalMessage}}\n{{#deadline}}\n\n>> The poll closes {{deadline}}. Answer before then so your vote counts.\n{{/deadline}}\n\nDATE PROPOSALS ({{optionCount}})\n{{#dates}}\n  - {{dateLabel}}\n{{/dates}}\n\nGo to the poll:\n{{{pollUrl}}}\n\n--\nYou’re getting this reminder because {{organizerName}} invited you via grabAday. {{#trackingEnabled}}Reminders are only sent to invitees who haven’t answered yet.{{/trackingEnabled}}{{^trackingEnabled}}Reminders are sent to all invitees who haven’t unsubscribed.{{/trackingEnabled}}\n{{#footerText}}{{footerText}}\n{{/footerText}}Unsubscribe from this poll: {{{unsubscribePollUrl}}}\nUnsubscribe from all emails: {{{unsubscribeAllUrl}}}\nReport abuse: {{{reportAbuseUrl}}}\nYour address is only used for this poll and is deleted automatically 90 days after it closes. Replies to this email are not read.\n"
